{"2244860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Demiurge's Soliloquy", "steam_appid": 2244860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soliloquy</i> is a narrative adventure game /walking sim that explores the depths of existence, faith and the human condition. It’s a story about a man stranded in a desert just to perform for a demiurge, the divine entity that created it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your narrative through fully voiced branching text decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an endless, procedural dune desert.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles manipulating simple elements that interact with the sun light and minimalist concrete structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace your free will choosing your own path in a non-linear experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an introspective journey that questions existence and the absurd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that the demiurge will watch every step.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soliloquy</i> is a narrative adventure game /walking sim that explores the depths of existence, faith and the human condition. It’s a story about a man stranded in a desert just to perform for a demiurge, the divine entity that created it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your narrative through fully voiced branching text decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an endless, procedural dune desert.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles manipulating simple elements that interact with the sun light and minimalist concrete structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace your free will choosing your own path in a non-linear experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an introspective journey that questions existence and the absurd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that the demiurge will watch every step.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A deity creates everything in pursuit for the most heartfelt human soliloquy, pulling him deeper into an existential journey. Traverse an endless desert filled with structures that defy meaning while you carefully choose your words.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Catalan<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244860/header.jpg?t=1784373680", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244860/21dce93fc6b155725c29167b9cc16a1fb24de37a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784373680", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244860/21dce93fc6b155725c29167b9cc16a1fb24de37a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784373680", "website": "https://noumeninteractive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1070 Ti or AMD Radeon™ RX 5700 or Intel® Arc™ A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> ntel Core i7-8700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® 2080RTX or AMD Ra